VO, Veoh, etc.\nCreate 3D movies with up to 6 different 3D effects available, edit disc menu and video effects.\nEdit DVD\/Blu-ray\/ video. DIY media files with useful video editing features\n\nFeaturing Blu-ray copy software and DVD copy software, Leawo Prof. Media enables you to copy and backup Blu-ray\/DVD disc, folder and ISO image file to computer or blank disc without quality loss, including: BD50, BD25, DVD9 and DVD5, and even compress Blu-ray\/DVD content with high quality.\nIt offers 3 copy modes: Full Movie, Main Movie and Custom Mode. That means it supports 1:1 Blu-ray\/DVD backup and movie-only backup. Featuring ISO image file copier, Leawo Prof. Media enables you to directly copy ISO image file to blank writable Blu-ray\/DVD disc within one click.\nInternal Video Editor to Customize Video Effect\nWith a video editor built in, Leawo Prof. Media enables you to customize media files and get an output file with your own patent, even create 3D movies, no matter you want to convert media or burn Blu-ray\/DVD.\nRegion-Free and Play Blu-ray Media File\nFar more than a media converter suite, Leawo Prof. Media acts as region-free Blu-ray media player software to play Blu-ray, DVD, HD video, audio and ISO image file. It is a region-free Blu-ray player that could play Blu-ray and DVD disc regardless of disc protection and region restriction. What\u2019s more, the built-in player enables you to preview editing effect, disc menu, 3D effect, subtitle and audio tracks, etc.\nOther Bonus Features for Better User Experience\nWith multiple other bonus features built in this total media converter combo, Leawo Prof. Media offers you more fun and enjoyment upon media conversions.\n\nRetain preferred subtitle and audio track. Leawo Prof Media enables you to freely select subtitles and audio tracks from source media files for output, even allowing you to add external subtitle to source video files. You could preview subtitle and audio tracks before selecting.\nDecrypt disc in 