\nSource Context:\nLeawo Prof Media is an ultimate 10-in-1 media solution with astonishing bonus features. It allows you to download online videos and audios, convert videos, DVDs, and Blu-rays.\nAlso you will able to copy DVDs and Blu-rays, burn videos to DVD and Blu-ray, edit videos, DVDs, and Blu-rays, play videos, DVDs, and Blu-rays, and so on.\nAs a total media converter suite, it integrates 10 programs into 1. This suite includes: HD Video Converter, Online Video Downloader, Blu-ray Ripper, Blu-ray Creator, Blu-ray Copy, DVD Ripper, DVD Creator, DVD Copy, Photo Maker and Photo to DVD\/Blu-ray Burner.\nLeawo Special Offers and Discounts \u2013 up to 70% OFF\nAs an online video downloader, Leawo Prof. Media enables you to download video and audio\/song from YouTube, Facebook, and other 100+ video sharing sites in different resolutions.\nThe software converts video and audio files, rip and convert Blu-ray\/DVD\/ISO files to video\/audio in 180+ formats, including MP4, AVI, FLV, WMV, MOV, M4V, F4V, MP3, AAC, etc.\nLeawo Prof Media converts Blu-ray, DVD, video, audio and ISO image files with high quality. Supports 1080p and even 4K video output, no quality loss in video and audio.\nLeawo Prof Media can adjust video and audio parameters of output files. That include video codec, quality, bit rate, aspect ratio, frame rate, audio codec, audio bit rate, sample rate, channel, etc.\nThis total media converter enables you to watch Blu-ray\/DVD\/Video files on various media players and devices like iPhone, iPad, Android devices, Microsoft devices, and others everywhere.\nLeawo Prof Media Key Features:\n\nConvert online videos, HD\/SD video, DVD and audios to more than 180 formats for iPhone, iPad, Galaxy S series, HTC New One, Xperia series, etc.\nBurn video to DVD and Blu-ray content with over 40 models of disc menu and templates preset.\nCopy DVD movies to computer or blank disc for backup with high quality, movie-only backup supported.\nDownload and convert videos from online video sharing sites like YouTube, Facebook, VEVO, Veoh, etc.\nCreate 3D movies with up to 6 different 3D effects available, edit disc menu and video effects.\nEdit DVD\/Blu-ray\/ video. DIY media files with useful video editing features\n\nFeaturing Blu-ray copy software and DVD copy software, Leawo Prof. Media enables you to copy and backup Blu-ray\/DVD disc, folder and ISO image file to computer or blank disc without quality loss, including: BD50, BD25, DVD9 and DVD5, and even compress Blu-ray\/DVD content with high quality.\nIt offers 3 copy modes: Full Movie, Main Movie and Custom Mode. That means it supports 1:1 Blu-ray\/DVD backup and movie-only backup. Featuring ISO image file copier, Leawo Prof. Media enables you to directly copy ISO image file to blank writable Blu-ray\/DVD disc within one click.\nInternal Video Editor to Customize Video Effect\nWith a video editor built in, Leawo Prof. Media enables you to customize media files and get an output file with your own patent, even create 3D movies, no matter you want to convert media or burn Blu-ray\/DVD.\nRegion-Free and Play Blu-ray Media File\nFar more than a media converter suite, Leawo Prof. Media acts as region-free Blu-ray media player software to play Blu-ray, DVD, HD video, audio and ISO image file. It is a region-free Blu-ray player that could play Blu-ray and DVD disc regardless of disc protection and region restriction. What\u2019s more, the built-in player enables you to preview editing effect, disc menu, 3D effect, subtitle and audio tracks, etc.\nOther Bonus Features for Better User Experience\nWith multiple other bonus features built in this total media converter combo, Leawo Prof. Media offers you more fun and enjoyment upon media conversions.\n\nRetain preferred subtitle and audio track. Leawo Prof Media enables you to freely select subtitles and audio tracks from source media files for output, even allowing you to add external subtitle to source video files. You could preview subtitle and audio tracks before selecting.\nDecrypt disc in advanced technology. Leawo Prof Media adopts could fast decrypt and rip Blu-ray disc with AACS, BD+ and the latest MKB protection, CSS-DVD disc, and remove disc region restriction of Blu-ray disc in A, B or C and DVD disc from region 0 to 6.\nDetermine burning engine and region at will. Leawo Prof Media offers you options to select burning engine from StarBurn and cdrecord, disc region, and CPU cores according to your own situation.\nMulti-lingual program interface. Leawo Prof Media is available in multiple languages, including: English, German, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Russian, Spanish, French, Portuguese, Dutch, Italian, and Danish.\nTake screenshot of loaded media freely. The attached camera function on the built in media player enables you to take screenshots and save in PNG, BMP, or JPEG image format.\n6X faster media conversion performance. Leawo Prof Media comes with NVIDIA CUDA, AMD APP, and Intel Quick Sync GPU accelerating technologies that could speed up disc reading, loading and processing at 6X faster speed.\n\n                \n\n                &lt;h3&gt;Changes in Leawo Prof Media 8.2.0.0&lt;\/h3&gt;\n\n\n\nAdded Cinavia Removal module to remove Cinavia watermark and other protections for Blu-ray backup.\nAdded support of H.264 and H.265 hard-decoding for faster disc processing.\nAdded lossless MP4 profile as output format.\nAdded an option to output forced subtitle only in Ripper module.\n\n\n            &lt;\/div&gt;\n\n                Homepage \u2013 &lt;a href=\"https:\/\/secure.avangate.com\/affiliate.php?ACCOUNT=LEAWOSOF&amp;AFFILIATE=22107&amp;PATH=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.leawo.org%2Ftotal-media-converter-ultimate%2F\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener sponsored\"&gt;https:\/\/www.leawo.org&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\nSupported Operating Systems:\n\n\nWindows 7, 8, 8.1, 10, 11.\nmacOS 10.13, 10,14, 10.15, 11.x, 12.x, 13.x, 14.x, 15.x\n\n\nLeawo Prof Media User Guide Video - How to Us