e and audio tracks before selecting.\nDecrypt disc in advanced technology. Leawo Prof Media adopts could fast decrypt and rip Blu-ray disc with AACS, BD+ and the latest MKB protection, CSS-DVD disc, and remove disc region restriction of Blu-ray disc in A, B or C and DVD disc from region 0 to 6.\nDetermine burning engine and region at will. Leawo Prof Media offers you options to select burning engine from StarBurn and cdrecord, disc region, and CPU cores according to your own situation.\nMulti-lingual program interface. Leawo Prof Media is available in multiple languages, including: English, German, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Russian, Spanish, French, Portuguese, Dutch, Italian, and Danish.\nTake screenshot of loaded media freely. The attached camera function on the built in media player enables you to take screenshots and save in PNG, BMP, or JPEG image format.\n6X faster media conversion performance. Leawo Prof Media comes with NVIDIA CUDA, AMD APP, and Intel Quick Sync GPU accelerating technologies that could speed up disc reading, loading and processing at 6X faster speed.\n\n                \n\n                &lt;h3&gt;Changes in Leawo Prof Media 8.2.0.0&lt;\/h3&gt;\n\n\n\nAdded Cinavia Removal module to remove Cinavia watermark and other protections for Blu-ray backup.\nAdded support of H.264 and H.265 hard-decoding for faster disc processing.\nAdded lossless MP4 profile as output format.\nAdded an option to output forced subtitle only in Ripper module.\n\n\n            &lt;\/div&gt;\n\n                Homepage \u2013 &lt;a href=\"https:\/\/secure.avangate.com\/affiliate.php?ACCOUNT=LEAWOSOF&amp;AFFILIATE=22107&amp;PATH=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.leawo.org%2Ftotal-media-converter-ultimate%2F\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener sponsored\"&gt;https:\/\/www.leawo.org&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\nSupported Operating Systems:\n\n\nWindows 7, 8, 8.1, 10, 11.\nmacOS 10.13, 10,14, 10.15, 11.x, 12.x, 13.x, 14.x, 15.x\n\n\nLeawo Prof Media User Guide Video - How to Us